[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0010","text":"早上好——！\n……我是第一个到的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0020","text":"“已经跟真乃碰头了\n　大概还有10分钟到”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0030","text":"“收到！　等你哦——！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0040","text":"啊，叶月小姐的便条……？\n────“冰箱里的牛奶请随意享用”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0050","text":"……对了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0060","text":"（滴点蜂蜜，放进微波炉……\n　好——的，开始加热！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0070","text":"（外面很冷嘛……\n　巡特制热牛奶，希望她们会喜欢呢）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0080","text":"啊……你提前到了呀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0090","text":"早上好，巡\n让你等了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300400_04_0100","text":"没有！　\n来得刚刚好！"}]
